<title>PHILIPPINES: RESEARCH ALERT - Cosmos rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cosmos rated a buy.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Hung Kai Securities (Phil) Inc on Wednesday recommended a buy for Cosmos Bottling Corp, saying it was the only company in the Philippines' beverage sector experiencing double-digit growth.</p>
</text>
